---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import me from '../assets/me.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
	<div class="page">
		<h1>Hi, I'm Bobby.🤌</h1>
		<p>
			I have been working as a junior frontend developer at <a href="https://www.gce.com">Grand Canyon Education</a> since October 2025, where I work with SvelteKit, Figma MCP and Cursor. 
		</p>
		
		<p>
			I absolutely <strong>love</strong> Linux distro ricing/customization. 🩵
			<br />
			Today, I use EndeavorOS with Hyprland as my daily driver, but I have used many other distros in the past, including:
			<ul>
				<li>Arch Linux</li>
				<li>Fedora</li>
				<li>Zorin OS</li>
				<li>Raspberry Pi OS</li>
				<li>Ubuntu</li>
				<li>and many more...</li>
			</ul>
		</p>
		<p>
			From my experience ricing Linux distros, I found my love for creating beautiful software frontends.
			<br />
			Thus, I decided to pursue a career in web development, self-teaching myself through <a href="https://www.theodinproject.com/">The Odin Project.</a>
		</p>
		<p>When I'm not on a computer, I'm usually cooking or working out. I have a personal soft spot for cooking Italian-American food, like pizza, chicken parm and bolognese. 😩
			<br />
			Keep an eye out for recipe drops in my written <a href="/articles">articles!</a>
		</p>
		<Image src={me} alt="Picture of Bobby Delucia" height={900}/>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page {
		width: 720px;
		max-width: calc(100% - var(--size-6, 2rem));
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.page img {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.page h1 {
		font-size: 2rem;
	}

	.page ul {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		list-style: circle;
	}
</style>
